@startuml
title Cloud Backend and Infrastructure Deployment

left to right direction

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 14
skinparam defaultFontSize 16
skinparam ArrowFontSize 14
skinparam nodesep 85
skinparam ranksep 70

node "Cloud Hosting Platform\nRender" as Render {

    node "FastAPI Backend\nWeb Service" as Backend {
        node "Python Runtime" as Python <<execution environment>> {
            artifact "Backend Application" as App
        }

        component "REST API" as API
        component "WebSocket Manager" as WebSocket
        component "MQTT Client" as MQTTClient
    }

    database "PostgreSQL\nDatabase Service" as Database
}

cloud "External MQTT Broker" as Broker

node "Authenticated Browser Clients" as Browsers
node "ESP32 Sensor Nodes" as SensorNodes <<device>>

Browsers --> API : HTTPS / JSON
WebSocket --> Browsers : WSS live updates

SensorNodes --> Broker : MQTT node events
Broker --> MQTTClient : Deliver events

MQTTClient --> Broker : Publish commands
Broker --> SensorNodes : Deliver commands

App --> API
App --> WebSocket
App --> MQTTClient

Backend --> Database : SQLAlchemy /\nPostgreSQL
Database --> Backend : Query results

@enduml